const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"搜索体现主动关注，但不说明看多或看空",en:"Searching signals active interest, not its direction"},body:{zh:"Da、Engelberg与Gao使用搜索频率研究注意力，与只观察新闻曝光相比，搜索更接近主动寻求信息的行为。但搜索某只股票并不告诉我们搜索者准备买入、卖出还是核查坏消息，也不能证明搜索者一定持有该股票。",en:"Search frequency is closer to active information seeking than media exposure alone. Yet searching a stock does not reveal whether someone intends to buy, sell or investigate bad news. Nor does it prove ownership of the security being searched."},reference:{url:"https://www.ou.edu/dam/price/Finance/files/Paul%20Gao%20Paper.pdf",label:{zh:"2010年6月3日作者稿 · §2 · p. 5",en:"June 3, 2010 manuscript · §2 · p. 5"}}},{title:{zh:"公司名与股票代码测到不同人群",en:"Company names and tickers can reach different audiences"},body:{zh:"公司名称可能被用于购物、求职或寻找门店，股票代码通常更接近金融信息需求，因此稿中主要用代码搜索。但某些代码本身也是常用词，会引入无关流量。实体匹配与歧义处理属于指标定义，不是可忽略的数据清洗细节。",en:"Company names can attract shopping, job or store-location searches, while tickers more closely target financial interest. Some tickers are ordinary words, however. Entity matching and ambiguity handling therefore define the measure rather than being negligible cleaning details."},reference:{url:"https://www.ou.edu/dam/price/Finance/files/Paul%20Gao%20Paper.pdf",label:{zh:"2010年6月3日作者稿 · §2 · pp. 5–6",en:"June 3, 2010 manuscript · §2 · pp. 5–6"}}},{title:{zh:"历史成分集合降低一种存续偏差",en:"Historical membership addresses one survivorship problem"},body:{zh:"作者使用研究期间曾进入Russell 3000的公司集合，而不是只拿期末仍在指数中的公司回看历史。这避免遗漏部分后来退出的证券，但仍有指数覆盖范围和价格筛选限制。样本曾经入选，也不等于整个时期都属于同一个指数。",en:"The draft includes firms that belonged to the Russell 3000 at any time during the study, rather than only end-period survivors. Index coverage and price filters still restrict the sample. Ever-membership does not imply continuous membership throughout the period."},reference:{url:"https://www.ou.edu/dam/price/Finance/files/Paul%20Gao%20Paper.pdf",label:{zh:"2010年6月3日作者稿 · §2 · p. 5",en:"June 3, 2010 manuscript · §2 · p. 5"}}},{title:{zh:"低搜索量的零值不应直接等同于无人关注",en:"Low-volume zeros do not establish zero attention"},body:{zh:"稿中说明部分低搜索频率的查询返回零，只有一部分公司周观测具有有效非零数据。这会改变哪些公司可被分析。缺少可发布搜索统计、真实零搜索和缺失下载不能随意合并，尤其不能把它们都当成精确的零注意力。",en:"Some rarely searched tickers return zero in the historical service, leaving only part of the firm-week sample with valid nonzero data. Unreportable low volume, true zero activity and a missing download should not be collapsed into an exact zero-attention observation."},reference:{url:"https://www.ou.edu/dam/price/Finance/files/Paul%20Gao%20Paper.pdf",label:{zh:"2010年6月3日作者稿 · §2 · p. 6",en:"June 3, 2010 manuscript · §2 · p. 6"}}},{title:{zh:"同一历史查询也可能有下载差异",en:"Repeated historical downloads can differ"},body:{zh:"作者记录当时平台使用抽样搜索数据，重复下载同一查询可能略有差异。这提醒读者，网页指标也有版本与抽样误差。保存查询条件、下载日期和原始返回有助于解释差别，但历史服务的描述不能作为今天平台实现方式的证明。",en:"The draft notes that the historical service sampled searches, so repeated downloads could differ. Web-based indicators have versions and sampling error too. Query settings, download dates and raw responses help explain discrepancies, without establishing how today's platform operates."},reference:{url:"https://www.ou.edu/dam/price/Finance/files/Paul%20Gao%20Paper.pdf",label:{zh:"2010年6月3日作者稿 · §2 · footnote 3",en:"June 3, 2010 manuscript · §2 · footnote 3"}}},{title:{zh:"与其他代理相关，不等于同一个变量",en:"Correlation with other proxies does not make them identical"},body:{zh:"文中将搜索指标与异常收益、换手、新闻及文本情绪比较。它们可能相关，但新闻供给、价格结果与主动信息需求不是同一概念。与注意力买卖行为研究并读时，应先比较测量对象，而不是把所有热度指标合成一个未经解释的分数。",en:"Search is compared with abnormal returns, turnover, news and textual sentiment. These may correlate while representing different objects: information supply, market outcomes and active demand. Read attention studies by comparing what is measured, not by merging all prominence measures into an unexplained score."},reference:{url:"https://www.ou.edu/dam/price/Finance/files/Paul%20Gao%20Paper.pdf",label:{zh:"2010年6月3日作者稿 · §3 · pp. 8–9",en:"June 3, 2010 manuscript · §3 · pp. 8–9"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"导读使用2010年稿中的历史Google搜索数据说明测量。搜索热度不是投资者身份、情绪方向或实际交易；历史下载口径不应被当作当前平台接口规范。",en:"The 2010 draft illustrates measurement with historical Google search data. Search intensity does not identify investors, sentiment or trades, and its download conventions are not current API specifications."}};export{e as default};
